<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem four callable notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem four callable notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association Tuesday said it will redeem four callable notes having a total par value of $215 million as follows.</p>
<p> Par Amount  Redemption  Interest   Maturity     Cusip</p>
<p> $50 million  12/30/96     6.00	9/30/97   86387RVW9</p>
<p> $50 million  01/02/97     6.075    10/02/97   86387RVZ2</p>
<p> $50 million  01/02/97     6.09     10/02/97   86387RVY5</p>
<p> $85 million  01/03/97     6.07	7/03/97   86387RUY6</p>
</text>
